Keep shell history after using dialog

Use dialogs' `--erase-on-exit` and `--stdout` options.
The use of `tput sgr && clear` clears the shell scroll hisotry.
This prevents users to scroll back and see what happened before the call to dialog.

Proposed upstream in https://github.com/thetechprepper/emcomm-tools-os-community/pull/85.
